turn": "void", "signature": "void close()", "full_signature": "@Override public void close()", "class_method_signature": "TalosStormSpout.close()", "testcase": false, "constructor": false}], "file": "galaxy-talos-client/galaxy-talos-storm/src/main/java/com/xiaomi/infra/galaxy/talos/storm/TalosStormSpout.java"}, "focal_method": {"identifier": "nextTuple", "parameters": "()", "modifiers": "@Override public", "return": "void", "body": "@Override\n    public void nextTuple() {\n        if (shouldCommit()) {\n            commitOffsets();\n        }\n\n        boolean emitted = false;\n        for (TalosStormMessageProcessor processor : msgProcessors.values()) {\n            Optional<PartitionMessagePool> msgPoolOpt = processor.getMessagePool();\n            if (msgPoolOpt.isPresent()) {\n                Optional<TalosStormMessage> msgOpt = msgPoolOpt.get().get();\n                if (msgOpt.isPresent()) {\n                    Iterable<List<Object>> tuples = talosConfig.talosScheme\n                            .generateTuples(msgOpt.get().topicPartition, msgOpt.get().message);\n                    for (List<Object> tuple : tuples) {\n                        collector.emit(tuple, msgOpt.get().id);\n                    }\n                    emitted = true;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        if (!emitted) {\n            try {\n                LOG.debug(String.format(\"No data to emmit, TalosStormSpout will sleep %dms\",\n                        idleMs));\n                Thread.sleep(idleMs);\n            } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n            }\n        }\n    }", "signature": "void nextTuple()", "full_signature": "@Override public void nextTuple()", "class_method_signature": "TalosStormSpout.nextTuple()", "testcase": false, "constructor": false, "invocations": ["shouldCommit", "commitOffsets", "values", "getMessagePool", "isPresent", "get", "get", "isPresent", "generateTuples", "get", "get", "emit", "get", "debug", "format", "sleep"]}, "repository": {"repo_id": 27764873, "url": "https://github.com/XiaoMi/galaxy-sdk-java", "language": "Java", "is_fork": false, "fork_count": 33, "stargazer_count": 42, "size": 9949, "license": "licensed"}}